t":"We off the grid, grid, grid","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-158","kind":"lyric","text":"This for my kid, kid, kid","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-159","kind":"lyric","text":"For when my kid, kid, kids have kids","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-160","kind":"lyric","text":"Everything we did for the crib","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-161","kind":"section","text":"[Outro: Kanye West]","columns":19,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-162","kind":"lyric","text":"N.C.","columns":4,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-163","kind":"lyric","text":"Pray for what folks and them did","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-164","kind":"lyric","text":"Only thing we pray God forgive-give-give","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-165","kind":"lyric","text":"May God forbid-bid-bid","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-166","kind":"lyric","text":"He hit one of the kids, kids, kids","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-167","kind":"lyric","text":"N.C.","columns":4,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-168","kind":"lyric","text":"Took off His list, list, list","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-169","kind":"lyric","text":"Look what they did, did, did","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-170","kind":"lyric","text":"Pray for the crib, crib, crib","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-171","kind":"lyric","text":"N.C.","columns":4,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-172","kind":"lyric","text":"Some say A-A-Adam could never be bla-a-ack","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[]}]}